      "note": "Directive says close authoring with sdd-log after a clean receipt, while the brief forbids approval claims and asks to stop at the boundary; sdd-check printed 'run sdd-log authoring-complete'. Decision to skip it was made from the brief, but the instruction conflict is not explicitly resolved in either file."
